xt":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"also named “RGAA”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","isActive":true}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"https://system.design.orange.com/0c1af118d/p/2531b9-accessibility-compliance":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the following guidelines"}],"url":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","title":"the following guidelines"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"title":"Foundations","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_layers.png"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Contains a set of helpers and extensions shared for higher level targets."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"ic_layers.png":{"type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png","tra